    "detailed_description": "A match-3 game about triangles! Match 3 or more triangles of the same color in various patterns to accumulate the highest score possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2>The perfect mode to just pick up and play! Enjoy your time while trying to beat your personal best!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dailies</h2>Compete against other players through online scoreboards. Everyone gets the same random generation and you can only try once per day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom</h2>Create your own custom game mode by manipulating a vast set of rules like board size, game speed and much more. You can then share your mode with friends and community by sharing a code they can paste into their own game.",
    "about_the_game": "A match-3 game about triangles! Match 3 or more triangles of the same color in various patterns to accumulate the highest score possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2>The perfect mode to just pick up and play! Enjoy your time while trying to beat your personal best!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dailies</h2>Compete against other players through online scoreboards. Everyone gets the same random generation and you can only try once per day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom</h2>Create your own custom game mode by manipulating a vast set of rules like board size, game speed and much more. You can then share your mode with friends and community by sharing a code they can paste into their own game.",
